{
  "_comment": "CodeBuddy CLI（腾讯）hook 模板。⚠️ WorkBuddy 不是本模板对象：WorkBuddy 只有 skills（~/.workbuddy/skills），没有 hooks。Windows 下 CodeBuddy 走 Git Bash，命令用 POSIX 风格 python3。",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 'HOOKS_DIR/workbuddy_adapter.py'",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 'HOOKS_DIR/workbuddy_adapter.py'",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}